{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Valentine in Bitterness&quot; is an game produced by \u30d7\u30e9\u30b9\u30ab\u30bc\u30c3\u30c8 and published by Hanabi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Yuki Katagiri, just an ordinary girl you can find anywhere, without anything I\u2019m particularly good at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somehow, I\u2019ve found someone I like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I was about to confess, my meddlesome older brother just had to tease me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wonder if things will go well on Valentine\u2019s Day\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundant CG content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999750?t=1757472872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999750?t=1757472872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999750/2bbb52cd494dec56f739643f35412034a6c83df2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757472872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999750/2bbb52cd494dec56f739643f35412034a6c83df2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757472872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Valentine in Bitterness&quot; is an game produced by \u3